# USB phone tethering as a WAN. ipheth plus usbmuxd/libimobiledevice for
# iPhone Personal Hotspot (usbmuxd keeps pairing records in /etc/lockdown);
# cdc-ether, rndis and cdc-ncm for Android phones and USB Ethernet dongles.
# Add the new interface as a WAN in LuCI after plugging the phone in.
CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-usb-net-ipheth=y
CONFIG_PACKAGE_usbmuxd=y
CONFIG_PACKAGE_libimobiledevice=y
CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-usb-net-cdc-ether=y
CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-usb-net-rndis=y
CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-usb-net-cdc-ncm=y
